       "PRINCIPLE_MULTIPLE_REPRESENTATIONS"
      ],
      "rationale": "Each table comes from a linear rule and sometimes starts at x = 0 and sometimes not. The student reads the rate of change from the steps in y, then works back to b. Negative slopes come up.",
